# Carlo Gavazzi EM270.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Carlo Gavazzi EM270 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: carlo-gavazzi-em270-modbus.pdf
# | - 3-phase 4-wire CT-connected energy meter, DIN-rail, RS485.
# | - Holding registers (FC03); FC03 and FC04 are interchangeable on this device.
# | - INT32 little-endian (LSW first), word_order = "le".
# | - Physical address = Modicom address − 300001.
# | - No per-phase power registers (CT model — only totals and V/I per phase).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Carlo Gavazzi
@model=EM270
@vendor_website=gavazziautomation.com
@description=3-phase 4-wire CT energy meter — per-phase V L-N and L-L, per-phase currents, total active/apparent power, demand, energy (INT32 LSW-first, holding registers).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/carlo-gavazzi-em270.toml; Source: carlo-gavazzi-em270-modbus.pdf. Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

